{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c5e7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae3f-54f0-7453-97f2-3b7774743ad2"},"sequence":334,"recorded_at":1780531400000663,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"932cad06-180f-40c2-8da9-e768b00b3c3d","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"932cad06-180f-40c2-8da9-e768b00b3c3d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"932cad06-180f-40c2-8da9-e768b00b3c3d"},"call_id":"call_01a0ae3fdfb072e79be7a5292c900fc1","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-z1yxg9/TASK-260830-z1yxg9_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-z1yxg9 conformance matrix (Section 11.10.4 HC-* gates)\n2|\n3|Authority: agent-session-manager-spec@v0.6.0, Section 11.10. Every vector\n4|runs through the production entries (`hostchannel.Serve`/`Dial`/`Call`,\n5|`VerifyPeer`, `EnrollmentPool`, `RunHandshake`, `NewHandshakeLimiter`,\n6|`AuthorityListOverflow`, `LaunchForConfig`, `WatchGeneration`, plus the\n7|`rpcwire` codec). Registry executable in `internal/hostchannel/gates_test.go`;\n8|mutants in `internal/hostchannel/mutations.py` (full suite per probe).\n9|\n10|## HC-TLS — TLS profile\n11|\n12|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n13|| --- | --- | --- |\n14|| Full TLS 1.3 + alpn + no-resume handshake, both roles | TestFullHandshakeHelloAndOperation (+) | — |\n15|| TLS 1.2 offer refused, both directions | TestRefusesTLS12Offer/server, /client (−) | tls-min, tls-min-client (both killed) |\n16|| Wrong ALPN refused, both directions | TestRefusesWrongALPN/server, /client (−) | — (protocol-level; supplement unit below) |\n17|| Missing ALPN refused (config cannot) | TestRefusesMissingALPN (−), TestVerifyPeerRefusals/missing-alpn (−) | alpn-supplement (killed) |\n18|| Wrong ALPN at supplement | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/alpn (−) | alpn-supplement (killed) |\n19|| Resumption refused across two sessions | TestRefusesResumption (−) | tickets (killed) |\n20|| Resumed state refused by supplement | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/resumed (−) | didresume (killed) |\n21|| Plaintext preface: alert-or-close, never JSON | TestRefusesPlaintextPreface (−) | — |\n22|| Silent peer hits the 10 s bound | TestSilentPeerHandshakeDeadline (−) | — |\n23|| Handshake byte cap exact boundary + disarm | TestHandshakeLimiterBounds (−/+) | handshake-cap (killed) |\n24|| Hostile intake bounded end to end | TestHandshakeIntakeIsBounded (−) | — |\n25|| Client cache without server tickets: harmless | — (bound) | client-cache (SURVIVED, one-sided weakening cannot resume) |\n26|\n27|## HC-CERT — enrolled credentials\n28|\n29|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n30|| --- | --- | --- |\n31|| Enrolled peer admitted | TestVerifyPeerAdmitsEnrolled (+), TestFullHandshakeHelloAndOperation (+) | — |\n32|| Unenrolled root refused | TestRefusesUnenrolledRoot (−) | — |\n33|| Revoked leaf refused | TestRefusesRevokedLeaf (−), TestVerifyPeerRefusals/revoked (−) | state-revoked (killed) |\n34|| Retired past retire_at refused | TestRefusesRetiredPastRetireAt (−), TestVerifyPeerRefusals/retiring-past (−) | state-retiring (killed) |\n35|| Retiring without bound refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/retiring-nil (−) | — |\n36|| Expired leaf refused | TestRefusesExpiredLeaf (−), TestVerifyPeerRefusals/expired (−) | profile (killed) |\n37|| Empty chains / empty certs refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/no-chains, /no-certificates (−) | chains (killed) |\n38|| Unknown leaf refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/unknown-leaf (−) | — |\n39|| Pool excludes revoked; overflow refuses activation | TestEnrollmentPoolExcludesRevoked (+), TestEnrollmentPoolRefusesOverflow (−) | ca-bound (killed) |\n40|| Leaf/key credential construction + refusals | TestCredentialFromIssued (+), TestCredentialFromIssuedRefusals (−) | — |\n41|\n42|## HC-MAP — exact match and naming\n43|\n44|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n45|| --- | --- | --- |\n46|| ServerName equals the issued leaf SAN | TestServerNameMatchesIssuedLeaf (+) | known-bad (killed) |\n47|| Double match refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/double-match (−) | match-count (killed) |\n48|| Leaf differing in one byte refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/leaf-flipped (−) | match-leaf (killed) |\n49|| Root differing in one byte refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/root-flipped (−) | match-root (killed) |\n50|| Wrong SPKI refused | TestVerifyPeerRefusals/spki-zero (−) | match-spki (killed) |\n51|| Wrong destination SAN refused at TLS | TestRefusesWrongServerName (−), TestRefusesDestinationMismatch (−) | — |\n52|\n53|## HC-HELLO — authorized hello\n54|\n55|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n56|| --- | --- | --- |\n57|| Full hello + operation, both roles | TestFullHandshakeHelloAndOperation (+), TestInventoryRootsThroughChannel (+) | — |\n58|| Fresh UUIDv7 correlators; local code/exit map | TestNewRequestID (+), TestLocalFailureMapping (+) | — |\n59|| Wrong hello ID refused, both roles (exact frame/exit) | TestRefusesHelloUUIDMismatch (−), TestRefusesServerHelloUUIDMismatch (−) | hello-id-server, hello-id-client (both killed) |\n60|| Destination mismatch refused | TestRefusesDestinationMismatch (−) | — |\n61|| Not allowlisted refused (exact frame/exit) | TestRefusesNotAllowlisted (−) | — |\n62|| Invalid hello refused (exact frame/exit) | TestRefusesInvalidHello/contract, /missing-key, /nonce (−) | — |\n63|| Hello failure frames mapped by initiator | TestHelloFailureMapping/host_identity_mismatch, /peer_not_allowlisted, /incompatible_protocol (−) | — |\n64|| Hello reply correlation enforced | TestHelloResponseCorrelation (−) | — |\n65|| Hello read/write deadlines | TestHelloDeadline/server, /client, TestHelloWriteDeadline (−) | — |\n66|\n67|## HC-DISPATCH — post-hello dispatch\n68|\n69|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n70|| --- | --- | --- |\n71|| Authorized call + framed handler error + continue | TestFullHandshakeHelloAndOperation (+), TestHandlerErrorFramedAndContinues (+) | — |\n72|| Non-hello before hello: one frame + close | TestRefusesNonHelloBeforeHello (−) | non-hello (killed) |\n73|| Foreign majors close silently | TestForeignMajorClosesSilently/2.0.0, /4.0.0 (−) | — |\n74|| Unframeable + oversize close silently | TestUnframeableHelloClosesSilently (−), TestOversizeHelloLine (−) | — |\n75|| Dispatch timeout + mid-stream expiry | TestDispatchTimeout (−), TestDispatchExpiryClosesWithoutFrame (−) | — |\n76|| Invalid call bodies + handler garbage | TestCallRefusesInvalidBody (−), TestHandlerGarbageBodyCloses (−) | — |\n77|| Re-hello is plain dispatch | TestRehelloIsPlainDispatch (+) | — |\n78|\n79|## HC-MIGRATE — Config 4 selection\n80|\n81|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n82|| --- | --- | --- |\n83|| Exact remote argv under Configuration 4 | TestLaunchForConfig (+), TestServeArgvPinsChannelVersion (+) | — |\n84|| Legacy/unbound/unknown refused | TestLaunchForConfigRefusesLegacy (−), TestLaunchForConfigEmptySnapshot (−), unknown-selector subcase (−) | — |\n85|| Activation refusals | TestInvalidActivation (−), TestLocalCredentialRefusals (−) | — |\n86|\n87|## HC-LIFECYCLE — credential lifecycle on the channel\n88|\n89|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n90|| --- | --- | --- |\n91|| Retiring within bound admitted; fresh boundary runs | TestRetiringCredentialAdmitsWithinBound (+), TestMutationBoundaryRunsFresh (+) | — |\n92|| Revoked / retired-past / expired refused | TestRefusesRevokedLeaf, TestRefusesRetiredPastRetireAt, TestRefusesExpiredLeaf (−) | state-revoked, state-retiring, profile (killed) |\n93|\n94|## HC-GENERATION — authorization currency\n95|\n96|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n97|| --- | --- | --- |\n98|| Bound stream runs at the committed generation | TestMutationBoundaryRunsFresh (+), TestFullHandshakeHelloAndOperation (+) | — |\n99|| Authority list bound exact | TestAuthorityListOverflow (+) | ca-bound (killed) |\n100|| Stale dispatch: server closes, client never sends | TestStaleGenerationAtDispatch/server_closes, /client_refuses_to_send (−) | stale-dispatch (killed) |\n101|| Stale mutation boundary never runs | TestStaleGenerationAtMutation (−) | stale-mutation (killed) |\n102|| Generation watch reports commits | TestWatchGeneration (−/+) | — |\n103|\n104|## HC-EXCLUDE — no durable writes, no leakage\n105|\n106|| Vector | Test | Mutant |\n107|| --- | --- | --- |\n108|| Static write/exec/listen/system-pool census | TestStaticWriteCensus (+) | census-evasion (passes static by design) |\n109|| Runtime census: state trees + trust bytes + temp tripwire | TestRuntimeWriteCensus (+) | census-evasion (killed behaviorally) |\n110|| Binding redaction | TestBindingRedaction (+) | — |\n111|\n112|## HC-PARITY — carrier independence\n113|\n114|Stated bound, not a test: the package takes an abstract ordered binary\n115|`Stream` and contains no SSH-implementation branch; the same TLS profile,\n116|supplement, and refusal table run over OpenSSH and native Tailscale SSH\n117|carriers. Positive evidence is every handshake test running over the\n118|transport-agnostic `Stream` interface.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
